OL,3,GNEWSASchoolboys' 1850s copy of Bayeux
OL,4,ATapestry restored
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe item had been held in storage until
OL,7,Frecently, when the museum decided to
OL,8,Frestore it after the original went on
OL,9,Fpublic display in the UK for the very
OL,10,Ffirst time.
